__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store

# macOS iCloud Drive sync conflict copies (Desktop is synced); e.g. "buggy 2.py".
# generate_tasks.py wipes+rewrites tasks/ rapidly, which can make the sync daemon
# snapshot a mid-write conflict copy. These are never real artifacts.
* [0-9].py
* [0-9].json
* [0-9].txt
* [0-9].md

# Per-step acceptance transcripts (e.g. acceptance_p15.txt) are working scratch,
# kept out of the tree and out of `git status` noise.
acceptance_p*.txt

# Phase 3 advisory episode logs are regenerated by the harness/tests; scratch, not tracked.
phase3_advisory/dev_logs/*.jsonl
